o-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Tim-Cook-Apple-Logo\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17259,\"date\":\"2026-08-28T12:46:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-28T10:46:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-velocizzare-indicizzazione-spotlight-iphone-ipad-mac\",\"title\":\"Apple spiega come velocizzare l’indicizzazione di Spotlight su iPhone, iPad e Mac\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple illustra come ottimizzare l’indicizzazione di Spotlight su iPhone, iPad e Mac per migliorare tempi di ricerca e reattività.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/Apple-Siri-AI-Spotlight-integration-260608_big.jpg.large_-768x512.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Siri-AI-Spotlight-integration-260608_big.jpg.large_\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17257,\"date\":\"2026-08-28T12:46:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-28T10:46:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"safari-technology-preview-251-update-bug-fix-performance\",\"title\":\"Safari Technology Preview 251: update con correzioni e miglioramenti\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple rilascia Safari Technology Preview 251, l’anteprima sperimentale di Safari. Disponibile via Aggiornamento software, è compatibile con le ultime versioni di macOS e punta a raccogliere feedback da sviluppatori e utenti.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/Safari-Technology-Preview-Updated-Feature-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Safari-Technology-Preview-Updated-Feature-1\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17255,\"date\":\"2026-08-28T12:24:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-28T10:24:00+00: